      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am using the sdk 3.8.1-beta 3, and I cannot get the validations to reappear. I have tried switching tabs on the sdk panel, closing and reopening the sdk panel, disabling and re-enabling the avatar, refreshing the sdk, switching the build platform, none of it brings the validations back. The only thing that has been working is closing and reopening the project, which is very annoying to do every time as the validations disappear very frequently now.",
